layout MAIN
aaammmppppp
ccccccccccc
sssssssssss
iiiiiiiiiii
kkkkkkkkkkk

legend:
- a ACTIONS size 22x7
- m MODELS size.width 30
- p PS
- c CHAT
- s SERVER size.height 5
- i ASK_LINE size.height 3
- k KEYS size.height 1

menu ACTIONS
- SERVE disabled when ok $(./ollama.sh up)
- STOP stop SERVE
- NEW_CHAT
- UNLOAD disabled when $MODEL == ""

> The models `ollama list` knows; Enter chooses one for the chat.

menu MODELS list
- source $(./ollama.sh list)
- filter
- keep
- then set MODEL $it

> Loaded models: name, then size and where it runs.

panel PS refresh 3s
TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT
ppppppppppppppppppppppppp
ppppppppppppppppppppppppp
ppppppppppppppppppppppppp
ppppppppppppppppppppppppp

legend:
- T text PS.TITLE
- p value $(./ollama.sh ps)

panel KEYS
kkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkk

legend:
- k text KEYS.TEXT

log CHAT history 2000
log SERVER history 500

input ASK_LINE
- var PROMPT
- then ASK
- clear
